# Defense-in-depth: current Dockerfiles COPY pom.xml/src selectively, not `COPY . .`,
# so this isn't closing an active leak — it guards against a future COPY . . regression.
# NOTE: this file applies only to a root-context build. The compose services build with each
# service dir as context (`build: ../rpe-<svc>`), where the per-service .dockerignore governs.
# Patterns are recursive (`**/`) so the four service target/ trees are covered here too.
**/target/
**/build/
**/out/
*.class
*.jar
!.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar
.git/
.gitignore
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
.env
*.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!*.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.log
logs/
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
data/
**/data/
